{
  "slug": "next-js-e-commerce-seo-skills-for-ai-coding-assistants",
  "name": "Next Js E Commerce Seo Skills For Ai Coding Assistants",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "SEO skills for AI coding assistants working on Next.js e-commerce sites. 10 auto-triggered skills cover metadata, structured data (JSON-LD), hreflang for multi-locale sites, image optimization, Core Web Vitals, URL structure, crawlability, internal linking, redirects, and e-commerce page patterns. 2 audit commands (/seo-audit-page, /seo-audit-component) produce PASS/WARN/FAIL checklists. Skills are advisory — they inform the assistant about SEO best practices so it can give good advice when asked, without making unsolicited code changes. Works with Next.js 15.x and 16.x, App Router and Pages Router.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **10 skills**, **1 agent** and **3 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (10): `seo-crawlability` (Crawlability, indexing, robots directives, and sitemap rules), `seo-ecommerce` (E-commerce specific SEO rules for product pages, category pages, pricing, availability, faceted navigation, and B2B considerations), `seo-hreflang` (Hreflang and internationalization SEO rules), `seo-images` (Image SEO and optimization rules for Next.js), `seo-internal-linking` (Internal linking strategy and rules for SEO), `seo-metadata` (SEO metadata rules for Next.js pages), `seo-performance` (Core Web Vitals and performance SEO rules for Next.js), `seo-redirects` (Redirect rules and patterns for SEO), and 2 more\n- **Agents** (1): `seo-auditor` (SEO specialist that reviews Next.js code for search engine optimization issues across metadata, structured data, images, links, crawlability,…)\n- **Commands** (3): `checklist`, `seo-audit-component`, `seo-audit-page`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install next-js-e-commerce-seo-skills-for-ai-coding-assistants@claude-community` from `mvstepanek/nextjs-ecommerce-seo-skills`.",
